cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these materials, please cite both the software/data record below and the associated manuscript."
title: "TurfEval Data Availability: data and code for automated turfgrass quality assessment from UAV imagery"
abstract: >-
  Plot-level data and analysis code supporting an evaluation of relationships
  between UAV-derived image predictors and visual turfgrass quality ratings on
  the NTEP 1 to 9 scale. Includes rater variability ratings, plot-level RGB and
  multispectral predictors paired with turf quality ratings, plot-boundary
  geometry for eight trial instances, and the R code that reproduces the
  reported correlation, rater agreement, and random forest classification
  results.
